  m_text: "A new small business owner should seriously consider buying disaster insurance
    because it can be the difference between recovering from a catastrophic event
    and permanently closing their doors.\_\n\nMany small businesses never reopen
    after a disaster, and relying on government assistance is not a reliable strategy
    for recovery."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
